did not have a significant effect on the ease of insertion in subjects having a repeat insertion of the LNG-IUS."},     
{"study_index": 9, "title": "Pain from copper intrauterine device insertion: randomized trial of prophylactic           
ibuprofen", "abstract": "OBJECTIVES This study was undertaken to determine whether 400 mg of prophylactic ibuprofen can 
